// Negative control for sfz-probe. Deliberately broken.
//
// This file exists so the dump's zero-results can be believed. A conformance
// tool that reports "nothing was rejected" is worthless until it has been shown
// to report something when something IS rejected.
//
// Run:   sfz-probe dump negative-control.sfz > /dev/null 2> stderr.txt
//
// Expected, and all four of these are load-bearing:
//
//   1. unknown_opcodes.count 2, naming another_bogus_opcode and
//      kromosynth_not_a_region_opcode. Note this holds even though the region
//      is removed at step 3 below: opcodes are parsed before regions are
//      culled, so the diagnostic survives the region not surviving.
//
//   2. The two bogus <control> opcodes do NOT appear in that list. They appear
//      only on stderr as "Unsupported control opcode:". This is the gap in
//      getUnknownOpcodes that would otherwise mislead - it is fed only from
//      Synth::Impl::buildRegion, and handleControlOpcodes routes unsupported
//      names to DBG().
//
//   3. load.ok is true and num_regions is 0, with stderr reporting
//      "Removing the region with sample ...". The sample does not exist, so
//      the region is culled after parsing and loadSfzFile still returns true.
//      "Loaded successfully" is not evidence that anything will play. A VI
//      artefact with a broken default_path would look exactly like this.
//
//   4. num_curves is 7 - the predefined set only, since no <curve> block is
//      declared here.
//
// NOT demonstrated by this file, because there is no surviving region to
// report on: sfizz accepts amplitude_curvecc85=10 and reports curve=10 even
// when curve 10 was never declared, falling back to a linear 0-to-1 ramp via
// CurveSet::getCurve. That was observed by pointing a copy of this file at a
// real WAV. See STAGE0_FINDINGS.md section F6.3 - it is a render-half test.
//
// The missing sample is intentional - it keeps this file self-contained and it
// is what demonstrates point 3. Do not "fix" it by adding a WAV.

<control>
default_path=samples/
set_cc85=64
kromosynth_not_a_control_opcode=1
hint_totally_made_up=7

<global>
kromosynth_not_a_region_opcode=1

<region> sample=does-not-exist.wav lokey=48 hikey=48 pitch_keycenter=48 another_bogus_opcode=3 amplitude_oncc85=100 amplitude_curvecc85=10
